Package: polaris
Title: High-Performance Spatial-Temporal Graph Routing and Mobility Engine
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Aneesh", email = "aneeshkrishnaparthasarathy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: High-performance spatial-temporal graph routing, multi-modal mobility,
    and autonomous logistics engine in R with native C acceleration. Implements
    Contraction Hierarchies, Viterbi HMM map matching, RAPTOR public transit routing,
    Frank-Wolfe traffic equilibrium, capacitated vehicle routing, and pure-R HTTP daemon.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
URL: https://github.com/Aneesh495/polaris
BugReports: https://github.com/Aneesh495/polaris/issues
NeedsCompilation: yes
